  "answer": "In 3 runs, nothing lost, each child's process start - raised at version 4 - carried every field as the workload read it before the child ran: App Installer's winget its package Microsoft.DesktopAppInstaller_1.29.250.0_x64__8wekyb3d8bbwe and application ID winget, the workload's own child an empty package and application ID, an observed none, and both their token's elevation type, elevation, integrity level and session. Every rundown record, at version 2, carried a process's package as the application model gave it as the rundown ran: 505, 505 and 510 processes read a run, 141, 141 and 142 of them packaged, none disagreeing. Each field was read by the registered layout past the mandatory label's SID, whose sub-authority count says where the image after it begins; TDH's own decoding by name lost every package after the SID, so a reader must read them as the product reads the image. No tier is assigned: the fields are measured, not yet admitted.",
